# Elixir
# website: https://elixir-lang.org
# docs: https://elixir-lang.org/docs/
# description: Elixir programming language ignoring Mix build artifacts, dependencies, test coverage, and language server caches.

# Compilation outputs and Mix dependencies
# The directory Mix will write compiled artifacts to
/_build/
# The directory Mix downloads your dependencies sources to
/deps/
*.beam

# Test coverage and temporary files
# If you run "mix test --cover", coverage assets end up here
/cover/
/tmp/

# Documentation generated by ExDoc
/doc/

# Crash dumps and archive artifacts
erl_crash.dump
*.ez
*.tar

# Sensitive configuration (older Phoenix applications)
/config/*.secret.exs

# Dialyzer persistent lookup tables
*.plt
*.plt.hash

# Language servers and IDE tooling
.elixir_ls/
.lexical/
.next_ls/